{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> 人稱Ming Sir的資深演員劉兆銘昨日（2日）離世，其好友丁羽證實其死訊。劉兆銘縱橫演藝界逾半世紀，在圈內地位舉足輕重，他更是首位為法國舞蹈家編舞的華人。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"VS--82013-2006-2015-myTVSUPER-13’48”.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026st95HiF90i1788402136.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"VS--82013-2006-2015-myTVSUPER-13’48”.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1e77f525-70bd-47dc-8b0a-ab705525.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uZoD7AHlQF1788402168.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1e77f525-70bd-47dc-8b0a-ab705525.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉兆銘晚年痛痛纏身，身體出現多種病痛，以及要輪椅代步，93歲生日時要在醫院度過，他曾說：「我依家講嘢都要唞啖氣，七樣病講五樣都講好耐。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T02:43:56.925239+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}